<title>USA: Monticello CSD, Iowa, won by Sterne Agee.</title>
<headline>Monticello CSD, Iowa, won by Sterne Agee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach, Inc., said it won $4.450 million of Monticello CSD, Iowa, general obligation school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.30 percent.</p>
</text>
